---
config:
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#4f46e5'
    primaryTextColor: '#e2e8f0'
    primaryBorderColor: '#6366f1'
    lineColor: '#94a3b8'
    textColor: '#e2e8f0'
    nodeTextColor: '#e2e8f0'
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> ACTIVE: 螢幕關閉 + 未充電

    ACTIVE --> INACTIVE: light_after_inactive_to<br/>(1m)

    INACTIVE --> IDLE: light_idle_to<br/>(首次 5m)

    IDLE --> MAINTENANCE: 進入維護窗口<br/>(1-5m budget)

    MAINTENANCE --> IDLE: 維護結束<br/>idle 時間遞增<br/>5m → 10m → 15m → 20m → 25m → 30m<br/>(線性 +5m/次, 上限 30m)

    IDLE --> ACTIVE: 螢幕開啟<br/>或開始充電
    INACTIVE --> ACTIVE: 螢幕開啟<br/>或開始充電
    MAINTENANCE --> ACTIVE: 螢幕開啟<br/>或開始充電

    state ACTIVE {
        [*]: 正常運作
    }
    state IDLE {
        [*]: App 受限<br/>Job/Sync 暫停<br/>Network 批次處理
    }
    state MAINTENANCE {
        [*]: 短暫解除限制<br/>處理延遲的工作
    }
